{"seq":1,"slug":"api-reference-design","title":"API 参考文档设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/technical-writing/api-documentation/api-reference-design","wordCount":1115,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"api-参考文档设计\">API 参考文档设计</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>API 参考文档的核心是<strong>让开发者在最短时间内找到所需信息并成功调用接口</strong>。它不同于教程和指南——参考文档面向知道要做什么、只需要精确规格的读者。</p>\n<p>设计良好的 API 参考围绕三个原则展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>从消费者视角组织</strong>：按资源而非内部实现分组，对齐开发者的心智模型</li>\n<li><strong>单一信息源</strong>：以 OpenAPI 规范为核心，所有文档与示例从中生成，避免多处维护产生偏差</li>\n<li><strong>可运行可验证</strong>：每个接口都有可直接复制的调用示例，并在 CI 中校验与规范同步</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>面向读者</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>概览层</td>\n<td>用途、基础 URL、认证</td>\n<td>首次接入的开发者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接口列表</td>\n<td>按资源分组的接口索引</td>\n<td>寻找特定接口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接口详情</td>\n<td>路径、参数、请求/响应</td>\n<td>实现调用的开发者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支撑信息</td>\n<td>错误码、速率限制、变更</td>\n<td>排错和运维</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"rest-api-文档结构\">REST API 文档结构</h2><p>一份完整的 REST API 参考文档应当包含以下核心模块，让开发者能够快速定位所需信息：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模块</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>优先级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>概述</td>\n<td>API 的用途、基础 URL、协议说明</td>\n<td>必选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>认证</td>\n<td>鉴权方式、Token 获取流程</td>\n<td>必选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接口列表</td>\n<td>按资源分组的接口索引</td>\n<td>必选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接口详情</td>\n<td>路径、方法、参数、请求/响应示例</td>\n<td>必选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误码</td>\n<td>全局错误码与业务错误码</td>\n<td>必选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速率限制</td>\n<td>请求频率限制与响应头说明</td>\n<td>推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变更日志</td>\n<td>版本间的差异与迁移指南</td>\n<td>推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SDK/工具</td>\n<td>官方 SDK 与社区工具链接</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"接口组织方式\">接口组织方式</h2><p>按资源 (Resource) 维度组织接口，每个资源下按 CRUD 操作排列：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"API 参考/&#10;├── 用户 (Users)&#10;│   ├── POST   /users          创建用户&#10;│   ├── GET    /users          获取用户列表&#10;│   ├── GET    /users/:id      获取用户详情&#10;│   ├── PUT    /users/:id      更新用户&#10;│   └── DELETE /users/:id      删除用户&#10;├── 订单 (Orders)&#10;│   ├── POST   /orders         创建订单&#10;│   └── GET    /orders/:id     获取订单详情&#10;└── 认证 (Auth)&#10;    ├── POST   /auth/login     登录&#10;    └── POST   /auth/refresh   刷新 Token\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>API 参考/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 用户 (Users)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── POST   /users          创建用户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── GET    /users          获取用户列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── GET    /users/:id      获取用户详情</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── PUT    /users/:id      更新用户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── DELETE /users/:id      删除用户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 订单 (Orders)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── POST   /orders         创建订单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── GET    /orders/:id     获取订单详情</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── 认证 (Auth)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── POST   /auth/login     登录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── POST   /auth/refresh   刷新 Token</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"版本化策略\">版本化策略</h2><p>API 文档必须与 API 版本严格对应，常见的版本化方式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>格式示例</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>URL 路径</td>\n<td><code>/v1/users</code></td>\n<td>直观，易于路由</td>\n<td>URL 冗余</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>请求头</td>\n<td><code>Accept: application/vnd.api+json;version=1</code></td>\n<td>URL 简洁</td>\n<td>不便调试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询参数</td>\n<td><code>/users?version=1</code></td>\n<td>灵活</td>\n<td>容易遗漏</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>文档中应明确标注每个接口所属版本，并对已废弃接口使用醒目标记：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"paths:&#10;  /v1/users:&#10;    get:&#10;      summary: 获取用户列表&#10;      deprecated: false&#10;  /v1/legacy/users:&#10;    get:&#10;      summary: 获取用户列表（旧版）&#10;      deprecated: true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">paths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  /v1/users</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">获取用户列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      deprecated</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  /v1/legacy/users</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">获取用户列表（旧版）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      deprecated</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"openapi-swagger-集成\">OpenAPI/Swagger 集成</h2><p>使用 OpenAPI 3.0 规范作为 API 文档的单一信息源，从规范文件自动生成文档：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"openapi: 3.0.3&#10;info:&#10;  title: 订单服务 API&#10;  version: 2.1.0&#10;  description: 提供订单创建、查询、取消等功能&#10;servers:&#10;  - url: https://api.example.com/v2&#10;    description: 生产环境&#10;  - url: https://staging-api.example.com/v2&#10;    description: 预发环境&#10;paths:&#10;  /orders:&#10;    post:&#10;      operationId: createOrder&#10;      summary: 创建订单&#10;      tags:&#10;        - 订单&#10;      requestBody:&#10;        required: true&#10;        content:&#10;          application/json:&#10;            schema:&#10;              $ref: &#39;#/components/schemas/CreateOrderRequest&#39;&#10;      responses:&#10;        &#39;201&#39;:&#10;          description: 订单创建成功&#10;          content:&#10;            application/json:&#10;              schema:&#10;                $ref: &#39;#/components/schemas/Order&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">openapi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.0.3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">info</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  title</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">订单服务 API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">提供订单创建、查询、取消等功能</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">servers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://api.example.com/v2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">生产环境</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://staging-api.example.com/v2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">预发环境</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">paths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  /orders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    post</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      operationId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">createOrder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">创建订单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      tags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">订单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      requestBody</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          application/json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            schema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              $ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#/components/schemas/CreateOrderRequest'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      responses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        '201'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">订单创建成功</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            application/json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              schema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                $ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#/components/schemas/Order'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常用文档生成工具对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>输入格式</th>\n<th>输出形式</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Swagger UI</td>\n<td>OpenAPI 3.x</td>\n<td>交互式网页</td>\n<td>支持在线调试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Redoc</td>\n<td>OpenAPI 3.x</td>\n<td>静态网页</td>\n<td>三栏布局，阅读体验好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stoplight</td>\n<td>OpenAPI 3.x</td>\n<td>平台托管</td>\n<td>支持协作编辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Slate</td>\n<td>Markdown</td>\n<td>静态网页</td>\n<td>代码示例并排展示</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"认证文档模式\">认证文档模式</h2><p>认证部分应作为独立章节，放在接口列表之前。推荐结构：</p>\n<h3 id=\"bearer-token-认证示例\">Bearer Token 认证示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"curl -X GET https://api.example.com/v2/users \\&#10;  -H &quot;Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9...&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -X</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> GET</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://api.example.com/v2/users</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -H</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9...\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"认证文档清单\">认证文档清单</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>认证方式</td>\n<td>Bearer Token / API Key / OAuth 2.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>获取凭证</td>\n<td>描述如何申请和获取认证凭证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Token 有效期</td>\n<td>明确过期时间与刷新机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权限范围</td>\n<td>列出可用的 scope 及其含义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误处理</td>\n<td>401/403 的返回格式与排查方式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全建议</td>\n<td>密钥保管、HTTPS 强制、最小权限原则</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"oauth-2-0-授权流程\">OAuth 2.0 授权流程</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;    participant A as 授权服务器&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;A: 1. 授权请求&#10;    A--&gt;&gt;C: 2. 返回授权码 (code)&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;A: 3. 用 code 换取 token&#10;    A--&gt;&gt;C: 4. 返回 access_token\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端\n    participant A as 授权服务器\n    C-&gt;&gt;A: 1. 授权请求\n    A--&gt;&gt;C: 2. 返回授权码 (code)\n    C-&gt;&gt;A: 3. 用 code 换取 token\n    A--&gt;&gt;C: 4. 返回 access_token</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>从消费者视角出发</strong>：文档的组织方式应对齐开发者的使用场景，而非内部实现</li>\n<li><strong>保持单一信息源</strong>：以 OpenAPI 规范文件为核心，所有文档从中生成</li>\n<li><strong>提供可运行示例</strong>：每个接口至少包含一个完整的 curl 示例</li>\n<li><strong>标注破坏性变更</strong>：版本升级时明确列出不兼容变更及迁移步骤</li>\n<li><strong>维护接口状态</strong>：对 <code>stable</code>、<code>beta</code>、<code>deprecated</code> 接口使用统一标签</li>\n<li><strong>自动化校验</strong>：在 CI 中校验 OpenAPI 文件的合法性与文档的同步性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>API 参考文档以「快速定位并成功调用」为目标，按资源而非内部实现组织内容</li>\n<li>完整结构包含概述、认证、接口列表、接口详情、错误码等模块，认证应独立成章前置</li>\n<li>版本化需与文档严格对应，废弃接口要有醒目标记</li>\n<li>以 OpenAPI 规范为单一信息源，自动生成文档避免与实现脱节</li>\n<li>每个接口提供可运行的 curl 示例，并在 CI 中校验规范合法性与文档同步性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"API 参考文档设计","id":"api-参考文档设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"REST API 文档结构","id":"rest-api-文档结构"},{"level":2,"text":"接口组织方式","id":"接口组织方式"},{"level":2,"text":"版本化策略","id":"版本化策略"},{"level":2,"text":"OpenAPI/Swagger 集成","id":"openapi-swagger-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"认证文档模式","id":"认证文档模式"},{"level":3,"text":"Bearer Token 认证示例","id":"bearer-token-认证示例"},{"level":3,"text":"认证文档清单","id":"认证文档清单"},{"level":3,"text":"OAuth 2.0 授权流程","id":"oauth-2-0-授权流程"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"工具链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/technical-writing/writing-fundamentals/toolchain"},"next":{"title":"接口描述规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/technical-writing/api-documentation/endpoint-descriptions"}}